      "message": "I don\u0027t think I like NewUnauthenticatedCipherX better. What are the advantages in your opinion?\n\nWe normally just don\u0027t implement drafts, but XChaCha20 has been a standard for years now, implemented in libsodium, used in XChaCha20Poly1305... it just lacked a formal spec. There is no chance it will change.",
